WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:04,780
Brother Zhang

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,060
I also visited the factory

3
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,580
Believe in the strength of our factory

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:08,980
You also have a certain understanding

5
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:09,980
Bro wants to know

6
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,900
What are your thoughts now, Brother Sun?

7
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,420
I've also checked the quality of the boats at your factory.

8
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,380
It is indeed good

9
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,100
But the construction period is indeed a bit long

10
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,620
Or brother, you can consider it

11
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,140
That 17-meter limited edition

12
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,460
It has good quality and complete and advanced equipment

13
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,460
As long as the money is in place

14
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,260
After adjusting the time, you can drive away

15
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,460
Something to say

16
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,100
This kind of configuration in this era

17
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,860
It's definitely excellent

18
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,180
Even if it takes another thirty years

19
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,460
Not too outdated

20
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,650
17 meter boat

21
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:37,060
What should I do if the price is even higher by a full 6,000 yuan?

22
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:39,460
I asked someone to borrow money and forced me to get into the car.

23
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,500
Or settle for the next best thing

24
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,380
Wait a year to buy a new boat

25
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:44,300
Sun Changchang, what is this?

26
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,620
This is information from other people who have booked a boat

27
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:47,940
Since the reform and opening up

28
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,620
More and more people are booking ships

29
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,380
In the past, most people ordered small wooden boats.

30
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:52,780
The proportion of people ordering tin boats now

31
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,860
significantly increased

32
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:55,900
Why does it take so long to order a ship?

33
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,100
It is precisely because of this

34
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,260
More tin boats will appear in the coming years

35
00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:01,020
They are all racing against time for documents

36
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,100
More than a year of construction period

37
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,580
It looks like it can be raised to several thousand dollars

38
00:01:03,620 --> 00:01:05,180
But how much less money will I make?

39
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:07,100
But having no money is not an option

40
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,820
Unless there is a place to borrow money

41
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:11,020
Sun Changchang

42
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:12,020
Frankly speaking

43
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:14,380
I really have my eye on this 17-meter fish boat.

44
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:17,540
But the money in my hand is really not enough, so

45
00:01:17,540 --> 00:01:19,460
I want to discuss it with you. Do you think it's okay?
